# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets — MUST stay first. .env holds live credentials and is never committed.
# The committed template is .env.example (placeholders only).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example

# Any stray credential material
*.pem
*.key
*credentials*
*secret*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Third-party transcript data — licensed for personal/educational use.
# Referenced and ingested at runtime, never redistributed in this repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/transcripts/
spike/evidence/
spike/results/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Assignment source material — Oogway Labs' own hiring document.
# This repo is public; the spec is not ours to redistribute. Kept locally,
# summarised in README.md instead.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Forward_Deployed_Engineer_Take_Home_Assignment.docx
*.docx

